---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const post = {
  title: 'Getting Started with WATeamInbox',
  date: 'December 15, 2025',
  readTime: '8 min read',
  category: 'Getting Started',
  author: 'WATeamInbox Team'
};
---

<Layout title={`${post.title} - WATeamInbox Blog`}>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="text-center">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <span class="rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-blue-800">
          {post.category}
        </span>
        <span class="text-gray-500">{post.readTime}</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl" data-testid="blog-post-title">
        {post.title}
      </h1>
      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-gray-600">
        <span>By {post.author}</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <time>{post.date}</time>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Featured Image -->
    <div class="mt-12 flex h-64 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-800 md:h-96">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-32 w-32 text-white/60" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
      </svg>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg mx-auto mt-12 max-w-3xl" data-testid="blog-post-content">
      <p class="lead text-xl text-gray-600">
        Welcome to WATeamInbox! This guide walks through setting up your account, connecting WhatsApp, and starting your first conversations.
      </p>

      <h2>Step 1: Create Your Account</h2>

      <h3>Sign Up</h3>
      <p>
        Visit the registration page and create your account:
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>Enter your email address</li>
        <li>Create a strong password (minimum 8 characters)</li>
        <li>Click "Create Account"</li>
      </ol>

      <h3>Verify Your Email</h3>
      <p>
        Check your inbox for a verification email. Click the verification link to confirm your account. The link expires in 24 hours.
      </p>

      <div class="rounded-lg bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 p-6 not-prose my-8">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-blue-800">Can't Find the Email?</h4>
            <p class="mt-1 text-blue-700">Check your spam folder. If you still can't find it, click "Resend verification email" on the login page.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>Step 2: Set Up Your Company</h2>

      <h3>Create a New Company</h3>
      <p>
        After logging in for the first time, you'll be prompted to create a company:
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>Enter your company name</li>
        <li>Click "Create Company"</li>
        <li>Your company workspace is now ready</li>
      </ol>

      <h3>Or Join an Existing Company</h3>
      <p>
        If you've received an invitation link:
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>Click the invitation link in your email</li>
        <li>Log in with your account</li>
        <li>Accept the invitation</li>
        <li>You're now part of the team</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Step 3: Connect Your WhatsApp</h2>

      <h3>Navigate to Settings</h3>
      <p>
        Click the settings icon in the sidebar to access the WhatsApp connection panel.
      </p>

      <h3>Scan the QR Code</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Open WhatsApp on your phone</li>
        <li>Go to Settings → Linked Devices</li>
        <li>Tap "Link a Device"</li>
        <li>Scan the QR code displayed on screen</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-6 not-prose my-8">
        <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Connection Status Indicators</h4>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-green-500"></div>
            <span class="text-gray-600">Connected - Ready to send and receive messages</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500"></div>
            <span class="text-gray-600">Connecting - Establishing connection</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></div>
            <span class="text-gray-600">Disconnected - Needs reconnection</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-gray-500"></div>
            <span class="text-gray-600">Not Connected - QR code not scanned</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3>Stay Connected</h3>
      <p>
        For the best experience:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Keep your phone connected to the internet</li>
        <li>Don't log out from WhatsApp on your phone</li>
        <li>Battery saver mode may affect connectivity</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Step 4: Your First Conversation</h2>

      <h3>View Your Chats</h3>
      <p>
        Once connected, your existing WhatsApp conversations will sync automatically. You'll see them in the chat list on the left side of the screen.
      </p>

      <h3>Send a Message</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Click on a contact in the chat list</li>
        <li>Type your message in the composer at the bottom</li>
        <li>Press Enter or click Send</li>
      </ol>

      <h3>Add a New Contact</h3>
      <p>
        To start a conversation with a new contact:
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li>Click the "+" button in the chat list</li>
        <li>Enter the phone number with country code</li>
        <li>Click "Create Contact"</li>
        <li>Start messaging</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Understanding the Interface</h2>

      <h3>Navigation</h3>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-6 not-prose my-8">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded bg-gray-200">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-gray-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="font-medium text-gray-900">Chats Tab</h5>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">View all individual conversations with contacts</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded bg-gray-200">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-gray-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="font-medium text-gray-900">Groups Tab</h5>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">View and manage group conversations</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded bg-gray-200">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-gray-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6.002 6.002 0 00-4-5.659V5a2 2 0 10-4 0v.341C7.67 6.165 6 8.388 6 11v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="font-medium text-gray-900">Status Tab</h5>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">View WhatsApp status updates from contacts</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3>Contact Profile</h3>
      <p>
        Click on a contact's name in the chat header to view their profile:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Custom name and notes</li>
        <li>Tags for organization</li>
        <li>Assignment status</li>
        <li>Contact information</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Keyboard Shortcuts</h2>
      <p>
        Speed up your workflow with these shortcuts:
      </p>

      <div class="rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-6 not-prose my-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div>
            <code class="rounded bg-gray-200 px-2 py-1 text-sm">Ctrl/Cmd + N</code>
            <span class="ml-2 text-sm text-gray-600">New chat</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <code class="rounded bg-gray-200 px-2 py-1 text-sm">Ctrl/Cmd + F</code>
            <span class="ml-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Search</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <code class="rounded bg-gray-200 px-2 py-1 text-sm">Enter</code>
            <span class="ml-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Send message</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <code class="rounded bg-gray-200 px-2 py-1 text-sm">Shift + Enter</code>
            <span class="ml-2 text-sm text-gray-600">New line</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <code class="rounded bg-gray-200 px-2 py-1 text-sm">↑ / ↓</code>
            <span class="ml-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Navigate chats</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <code class="rounded bg-gray-200 px-2 py-1 text-sm">Ctrl/Cmd + /</code>
            <span class="ml-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Show all shortcuts</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>Next Steps</h2>
      <p>
        Now that you're set up, explore these features:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Dashboard</strong> - View message statistics and analytics</li>
        <li><strong>Team Management</strong> - Invite team members to collaborate</li>
        <li><strong>Quick Replies</strong> - Create templates for common responses</li>
        <li><strong>Contact Tags</strong> - Organize contacts with custom labels</li>
        <li><strong>Export</strong> - Backup your conversations and contacts</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Getting Help</h2>
      <p>
        Need assistance? Here are your options:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Documentation</strong> - Browse the full documentation at /docs</li>
        <li><strong>Community Support</strong> - Search or open an issue at <a href="https://github.com/ygncode/wateaminbox/issues">GitHub Issues</a></li>
        <li><strong>Security Reports</strong> - Follow the private process in the repository's <a href="https://github.com/ygncode/wateaminbox/blob/main/SECURITY.md">security policy</a></li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        Welcome to WATeamInbox! We hope it helps your team collaborate on business communications.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Author Bio -->
    <div class="mt-16 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <div class="flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-100">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-blue-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">{post.author}</p>
          <p class="text-gray-600">Building the future of business communication.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Posts -->
    <div class="mt-16 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Continue Learning</h3>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <a href="/blog/team-collaboration-best-practices" class="group rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md">
          <span class="text-sm text-emerald-600">Guide</span>
          <h4 class="mt-2 font-semibold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-primary-600">Team Collaboration Best Practices</h4>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/security-best-practices-whatsapp-web" class="group rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md">
          <span class="text-sm text-red-600">Security</span>
          <h4 class="mt-2 font-semibold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-primary-600">Security Best Practices for WATeamInbox</h4>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Back to Blog -->
    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a href="/blog" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
        </svg>
        Back to Blog
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
